sequenceDiagram
    participant A
    participant B
    A->B: Solid line
    A-->B: Dotted line
    A->>B: Solid arrow
    A-->>B: Dotted arrow
    A<<->>B: Solid both ways
    A<<-->>B: Dotted both ways
    A-xB: Solid cross
    A--xB: Dotted cross
    A-)B: Solid open arrow
    A--)B: Dotted open arrow
    A-|\B: Top half
    A--|/B: Bottom half dotted
    B/|-A: Top half reverse
    B\|--A: Bottom half reverse dotted
    A-\\B: Top stick
    A--//B: Bottom stick dotted
    B//-A: Top stick reverse
    B\\--A: Bottom stick reverse dotted
    A->>()B: Central at the receiver
    A()->>B: Central at the sender
    B()->>()A: Central at both
    A->>+B: Activate
    B-->>-A: Deactivate
    A->>A: Self
    A-->>A: Self dotted
